...

↓ CORRECT RESPONSE (skip principles) ↓
{
  "blocks": []
}

EXPLANATION: These are PRINCIPLES (foundational concepts), NOT assessment criteria.
NO "المعيار" keyword = NOT a criterion = SKIP
```

